{"version":1,"content":"<p>《塞爾達傳説：時之笛》裏的娜薇是整個系列最具標誌性的精靈夥伴。那句總在耳邊念叨的「嘿，聽我説」煩人又可愛，時隔多年依舊是塞爾達系列的經典記憶。然而這隻小精靈的最初設定，和我們如今熟知喜愛的帶翅膀發光小球截然不同——她最終呈現出這個形象，完全是受任天堂64主機的技術限制。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583668.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:31:38.803338+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:20:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:27:48.697017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:27:48.697017+00:00","content_hash":"b031109a70bd6e4571994e08becbfc83aefc5c61736848b3210ee568173842fa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}